{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DIMENSIONS AND BIOMES:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through multiple Dimensions and their completely unique biomes via the Dimensional Portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RESOURCES COLLECTION: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Dimension and biome has its own nature and enemies that allow you to obtain unique natural resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STRUCTURES: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Small buildings that can perform a wide variety of tasks, from extracting minerals from mines and crafting new items to generating and distributing electricit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AUTOMATION:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use drones to automate all your structures, from furnaces and extractors to power plants and electric turbines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CROPS, TRADER AND CRAFTSMAN: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow multiple crops, sell them to the Traveling Merchant, earn money in return, and have the Artisan craft high-level structures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MOTOR DIMENSIONAL:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress, unlock new materials and high-level structures, and build the greatest invention in the universe, the &quot;DIMENSIONAL ENGINE&quot;.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704010?t=1749091691","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704010?t=1749091691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704010/a4e7bcdcac62f592d79738cfa8208a14b89d554b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749091691","capsule_imagev5":"ht